define agent tutor.

open chat lesson.
  tell tutor text, explain what a variable is in programming.
  hear from tutor as explanation.
  say the payload of explanation.

  tell tutor text, now explain loops using that concept.
  hear from tutor as followup.
  say the payload of followup.

  say text, tokens used so far.
  set total to the tokens of explanation plus the tokens of followup.
  say total.
close chat.
